{"words": [{"text": "فَلَمَّا", "translation": "Then when"}, {"text": "وَضَعَتْهَا", "translation": "she delivered her"}, {"text": "قَالَتْ", "translation": "she said"}, {"text": "رَبِّ", "translation": "My Lord"}, {"text": "إِنِّى", "translation": "indeed I"}, {"text": "وَضَعْتُهَآ", "translation": "[I] (have) delivered [her]"}, {"text": "أُنثَىٰ", "translation": "a female"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "أَعْلَمُ", "translation": "knows better"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "[of] what"}, {"text": "وَضَعَتْ", "translation": "she delivered"}, {"text": "وَلَيْسَ", "translation": "and is not"}, {"text": "ٱلذَّكَرُ", "translation": "the male"}, {"text": "كَٱلْأُنثَىٰ ۖ", "translation": "like the female"}, {"text": "وَإِنِّى", "translation": "And that I"}, {"text": "سَمَّيْتُهَا", "translation": "[I] (have) named her"}, {"text": "مَرْيَمَ", "translation": "Maryam"}, {"text": "وَإِنِّىٓ", "translation": "and that I"}, {"text": "أُعِيذُهَا", "translation": "[I] seek refuge for her"}, {"text": "بِكَ", "translation": "in You"}, {"text": "وَذُرِّيَّتَهَا", "translation": "and her offspring"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ", "translation": "the Shaitaan"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّجِيمِ", "translation": "the rejected"}], "sahih": "But when she delivered her, she said, \"My Lord, I have delivered a female.\" And Allāh was most knowing of what she delivered, and the male is not like the female. \"And I have named her Mary, and I seek refuge for her in You and [for] her descendants from Satan, the expelled [from the mercy of Allāh].\""}